          }
        },
        {
          "published_at": "2026-10-14T22:41:59.408Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/thorstenball/status/2110501399041823219",
          "topic": "First-principles prompting for organizational reviews",
          "text": "What I find the most fascinating about this post:\n\nHow much first-principles thinking goes into these seemingly simple prompts.\n\nI don't know many people who could write\n\n\"review exists so leadership catches problems early and moves money and people to right places.\"",
          "quote_tweet": {
            "url": "https://x.com/felixrieseberg/status/2110023283169247623",
            "published_at": "2026-10-13T15:02:07.701Z",
            "author": {
              "name": "Felix Rieseberg",
              "handle": "felixrieseberg"
            },
            "text": "Hi, I'm Felix. I'm an eng lead working on Claude. I love watching people take flight and do things they never thought possible.\n\nWe often describe that as \"being more ambitious\" when using AI, which is tricky advice to follow. I wrote a tutorial:\n\nfelixrieseberg.com/how-to-be-more…",
